WEBVTT

00:27:57.965 --> 00:28:02.171
And I think what I probably am
is a very resourceful person

00:28:02.195 --> 00:28:06.354
who realized at an early age
that it was on me

00:28:06.378 --> 00:28:09.289
to figure out my life.

00:28:09.728 --> 00:28:11.697
AG: During her early days as an animator,

00:28:11.721 --> 00:28:13.891
Lynda encountered her first computer.

00:28:13.915 --> 00:28:16.705
She was unimpressed, at first.

00:28:16.729 --> 00:28:20.774
LW: It was a Apple II Plus clone

00:28:20.798 --> 00:28:23.599
that my boyfriend brought home,

00:28:23.623 --> 00:28:26.278
and so to please him, I turned it on

00:28:26.302 --> 00:28:28.651
and I started pecking at the keys

00:28:28.675 --> 00:28:33.263
and I caught the bug
that so many people since have caught.